SUMMARY:Dark Moon Lilith Astrology Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nJoin us in a discussion on Dark Moon Lili
 th. What is she telling us as she moves through different aspects of our c
 hart. In this 90 minute session we will discuss both natal and transit Lil
 ith placements.\n\n***Note***: Bring your chart if you have it or we can h
 elp when you arrive. Birth times are not required but always encouraged fo
 r more personal accuracy.\nJenn has been a practicing Astrologer for 8+ ye
 ars and offers Astrology readings online and in Asheville\n*Donation Event
  $ reccomended $15 - $30 per person*
